{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Adira, a lost girl in a lost world, in her quest through the mysterious land of Solacinity to conquer her doubts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adira's trusty Double Jump will help you cross large gaps, weave between spikes and climb tall cliffs! Both of your jumps will replenish upon touching the ground or certain objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solacinity is packed full of useful gizmos to aid Adira in her journey. Restore your jumps mid-air with ReJump Orbs. Take advantage of Springs to launch yourself in certain directions. Face a giant number of other challenges too, like Electricity puzzles, Teleportation Portals, Bosses, and even your own memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Chapter contains numerous optional Stars! Collect as many as you can for the chance to unlock some extra special content...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall down a pit, or collide with Spikes or other obstacles? No worry! You'll be brought right back to the start of the current room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the expansive story of Adira and Solacinity's other wanderers throughout your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lands ahead are unknown. That is, until you set out to know them...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277860?t=1744316757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744316757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/ec4f9a7b218485c4a5c4623e1d328952248ee8cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744316757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/ec4f9a7b218485c4a5c4623e1d328952248ee8cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744316757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Adira, a lost girl in a lost world, in her quest through the mysterious land of Solacinity to conquer her doubts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adira's trusty Double Jump will help you cross large gaps, weave between spikes and climb tall cliffs! Both of your jumps will replenish upon touching the ground or certain objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solacinity is packed full of useful gizmos to aid Adira in her journey. Restore your jumps mid-air with ReJump Orbs. Take advantage of Springs to launch yourself in certain directions. Face a giant number of other challenges too, like Electricity puzzles, Teleportation Portals, Bosses, and even your own memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Chapter contains numerous optional Stars! Collect as many as you can for the chance to unlock some extra special content...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall down a pit, or collide with Spikes or other obstacles? No worry! You'll be brought right back to the start of the current room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the expansive story of Adira and Solacinity's other wanderers throughout your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lands ahead are unknown. That is, until you set out to know them...</p></li></ul>","developers":["GHS. Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/header.jpg?t=1744316757","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124610,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124610/movie480.mp4?t=1744316756","max":"http://video.akamai.steams